@ProductsApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5058
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Login (no token required)
# @name login
POST {{ProductsApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Products without token — expect 401
GET {{ProductsApi_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Products with token
GET {{ProductsApi_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
